"""Chlorophyll-binding protein classifier utilities.

This module provides a cleaned and documented workflow for:
1. Loading and filtering protein embedding files.
2. Building a balanced sampled dataset across classes.
3. Padding sequence tensors for model inference.
4. Running one-batch attention visualization from a trained model.

Notes
-----
The project depends on custom modules and project-specific assets:
- ``cus_load_embedd`` for data loader/model helpers.
- Local embedding directories containing ``torch.load``-able dictionaries.
- A model class named ``Chl_Classifier_5`` available at runtime.

The previous version of this script executed immediately on import and relied on
many implicit globals. This rewrite makes all dependencies explicit and keeps
execution under ``main()`` for safer reuse.
"""

